{
"#name"
:
{
"ccal"
:
null
,
"en"
:
"Chinese Lunar Calendar"
,
"cn"
:
"中国农历"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"The ccal module is a terminal-based calendar tool designed for Chinese users.\nIt provides a clear view of both Gregorian and lunar calendars, including solar terms, traditional Chinese holidays, sexagenary cycle (heavenly stems and earthly branches), six-day cycle, and daily almanac guidance for auspicious and inauspicious activities.\nIdeal for checking Chinese festivals or consulting the traditional calendar for daily planning.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"ccal 模块是专为中文用户设计的终端日历工具，支持农历、节气和传统节日的显示。\n它以简洁的方式呈现公历与农历对照日历，并提供干支纪年、黄历宜忌、六曜等信息，适合查阅每日黄历或节日安排。\n"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ccal"
,
"en"
:
"Print this month's calendar and today's lunar calendar, solar terms, zodiac signs, duty days, taboos and other detailed information."
,
"cn"
:
"打印本月日历和今日农历、节气、干支、值日、宜忌等详细信息"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ccal i 2025-06"
,
"en"
:
"Print a calendar for June 2025."
,
"cn"
:
"打印 2025 年 6 月的日历"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ccal fz"
,
"cn"
:
"使用 fzf 提供交互式日历查询体验，可快速跳转到指定日期或节日。"
,
"en"
:
"Use fzf to provide an interactive calendar interface, allowing quick jumps to specific dates or holidays."
}
]
,
"fz"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"使用 fzf 提供交互式日历查询体验，可快速跳转到指定日期或节日。"
,
"en"
:
"Use fzf to provide an interactive calendar interface, allowing quick jumps to specific dates or holidays."
}
}
,
"info|i"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Show today's detailed lunar info, including solar terms, zodiac, and daily \"almanac\" tips."
,
"cn"
:
"显示今日农历详情，包括节气、干支、宜忌等黄历信息"
}
}
,
"init"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Initialize the configuration using interactive mode"
,
"cn"
:
"使用交互模式初始化配置"
}
}
,
"--cfg"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"管理日历中星期的命名、黄历宜忌是否显示等配置"
,
"en"
:
"Configuration for the naming of days of the week in the calendar, and whether to display the Chinese Almanac (Huangli) auspicious/inauspicious information, etc."
}
,
"clear"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Clear all setting default in the current session and reback the default value of the config record"
,
"cn"
:
"清除当前会话设置的默认值, 恢复为配置记录默认值"
}
}
,
"cat"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"List all current value in the session"
,
"cn"
:
"获取当前会话设置的所有默认值"
}
}
,
"#n"
:
{
"#cand"
:
[
{
"infolunar="
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Whether to display lunar calendar information"
,
"cn"
:
